<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="487003518"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538286928"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="sh0ut"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="SawanoHiroyuki[nZk] / Tielle / R!N/Gemie"/><amll:meta key="album" value="gravityWall/sh0ut"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:05.427"><div begin="00:04.821" end="03:55.418"><p begin="00:04.821" end="00:09.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Time has come to listen to the crying of their puppet souls<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间已到 倾听他们傀儡般的哀嚎</span></p><p begin="00:09.026" end="00:11.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">君がそんなにもっと楽をして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯当下的享乐是你所愿</span></p><p begin="00:11.481" end="00:13.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">行き詰まった未来と合図<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但未来似乎已举步维艰</span></p><p begin="00:13.451" end="00:15.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Words are strong, heart is dropped<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">饱含力量的文字 坠入深渊的心四处飞散支离破碎</span></p><p begin="00:15.479" end="00:17.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Scatter around and falls</p><p begin="00:17.945" end="00:20.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">偽りの Contact-everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世间万物皆为镜花水月</span></p><p begin="00:20.438" end="00:22.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">誘い込んだ傷が混ざる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">引诱着你陷入伤痛之中</span></p><p begin="00:22.593" end="00:26.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">誰も忘れた悲しみが Fall out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">结果迎来谁都已经忘却的悲恸</span></p><p begin="00:26.867" end="00:31.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">偽名はただ凍る 希望のジレンマ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚名荡然无存 希望渺无踪迹</span></p><p begin="00:31.579" end="00:36.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">息そぎ落とす行動も抑える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">屏住呼吸 抑制冲动</span></p><p begin="00:36.327" end="00:44.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">そう わかってる答えなど捨ててしまえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将已然确认的答案</span></p><p begin="00:44.614" end="00:48.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Yeah, get started breaking the row<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 冲破世界的禁锢</span></p><p begin="00:48.961" end="00:51.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">See how it spreads out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看看战火如何蔓延 这将颠覆我们认知的一切</span></p><p begin="00:51.400" end="00:54.306" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">It's beyond full realization</p><p begin="00:54.306" end="00:57.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Yeah, get started re-creating the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重新构架这纷繁世界</span></p><p begin="00:57.949" end="01:00.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Take my hands till the end<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牵着我的手 直到世界尽头 感受这份真挚的感情</span></p><p begin="01:00.584" end="01:03.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Feel this, raw, raw, raw emotion</p><p begin="01:03.646" end="01:06.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Bring it on down, rock, rock, rock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在颤动中 击坠一切</span></p><p begin="01:06.049" end="01:07.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Shake it up, up, tap, top, top<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撼动世界 直至极限</span></p><p begin="01:07.890" end="01:12.467" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Cuz I know how to shout out my soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道 如何为自己的灵魂呐喊</span></p><p begin="01:12.467" end="01:14.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Bring it on down, rock, rock, rock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在颤动中 击坠一切</span></p><p begin="01:14.661" end="01:16.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Shake it up, up, tap, top, top<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撼动世界 直至极限</span></p><p begin="01:16.966" end="01:21.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Cuz you know how to shout out your soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你知道 如何为自己的灵魂呐喊</span></p><p begin="01:23.622" end="01:26.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I've got a feeling, you must let me go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经找到那种感觉 你一定会放手让我离开</span></p><p begin="01:26.009" end="01:28.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I wanna keep my faith forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想永远坚守自己的信念</span></p><p begin="01:28.188" end="01:30.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Words are alive, supporting us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真诚的誓言给予我们力量 让我们的灵魂彼此相连</span></p><p begin="01:30.311" end="01:32.647" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Connecting with the souls</p><p begin="01:32.647" end="01:35.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I'm gonna fight them all to let you go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将与千军万马为敌 只为让你逃出苦海</span></p><p begin="01:35.213" end="01:37.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I wanna seek my way to answer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想找到属于自己的答案</span></p><p begin="01:37.117" end="01:39.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Words are alive, supporting us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真诚的誓言给予我们力量 让我们的灵魂彼此相连</span></p><p begin="01:39.194" end="01:41.679" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Connecting with the souls</p><p begin="01:41.679" end="01:46.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">You know what? We look up to the sky, count on it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道 我们仰望苍穹 虔诚祈祷</span></p><p begin="01:46.189" end="01:50.102" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">And halos in the clouds light me up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">云中圣光点亮了我的希望 然后我清醒过来</span></p><p begin="01:50.102" end="01:51.317" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Then I awake</p><p begin="01:51.317" end="01:56.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">In the heat, get fired up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无穷的热量将我唤醒，将我点燃，你们将呼唤我的名字</span></p><p begin="01:56.177" end="01:59.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">You'll call my name</p><p begin="01:59.800" end="02:03.332" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Yeah, get started breaking the row<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 冲破世界的禁锢 看看战火如何蔓延</span></p><p begin="02:03.332" end="02:06.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">See how it spreads out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这将颠覆我们认知的一切</span></p><p begin="02:06.073" end="02:08.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">It's beyond full realization</p><p begin="02:08.927" end="02:12.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Yeah, get started re-creating the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重新构架这纷繁世界</span></p><p begin="02:12.943" end="02:15.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Take my hands till the end<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牵着我的手 直到世界尽头 感受这份真挚的感情</span></p><p begin="02:15.039" end="02:18.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Feel this raw, raw, raw emotion</p><p begin="02:18.064" end="02:20.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Bring it on down rock, rock, rock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在颤动中 击坠一切</span></p><p begin="02:20.684" end="02:22.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Shake it up, up,  tap, top, top<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撼动世界 直至极限</span></p><p begin="02:22.632" end="02:27.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Cuz I know how to shout out my soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道 如何为自己的灵魂呐喊</span></p><p begin="02:27.002" end="02:29.295" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Bring it on down rock, rock, rock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在颤动中 击坠一切</span></p><p begin="02:29.295" end="02:31.567" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Shake it up, up, tap, top, top<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撼动世界 直至极限</span></p><p begin="02:31.567" end="02:36.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">Cuz you know how to shout out your soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你知道 如何为自己的灵魂呐喊</span></p><p begin="02:56.776" end="03:01.033" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">偽名はただ凍る 希望のジレンマ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚名荡然无存 希望渺无踪迹</span></p><p begin="03:01.033" end="03:05.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">息そぎ落とす行動も抑える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">屏住呼吸 抑制冲动</span></p><p begin="03:05.442" end="03:13.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">そう わかってる答えなど捨ててしまえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用手中仅有的真相孤注一掷吧</span></p><p begin="03:13.884" end="03:18.144" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Whoa yeah, get started breaking the row<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 冲破世界的禁锢</span></p><p begin="03:18.144" end="03:20.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">See how it spreads out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看看战火如何蔓延 这将颠覆我们认知的一切</span></p><p begin="03:20.695" end="03:23.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">It's beyond full realization</p><p begin="03:23.540" end="03:27.245" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">Yeah, get started re-creating the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重新构架这纷繁世界</span></p><p begin="03:27.245" end="03:29.883" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">Take my hands till the end<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牵着我的手 直到世界尽头 感受这份真挚的感情</span></p><p begin="03:29.883" end="03:32.975" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">Feel this raw, raw, raw, emotion</p><p begin="03:32.975" end="03:34.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">Bring it on down rock, rock, rock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在颤动中 击坠一切</span></p><p begin="03:34.957" end="03:37.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">Shake it up, up, tap, top, top<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撼动世界 直至极限</span></p><p begin="03:37.121" end="03:41.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">Cuz I know how to shout out my soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道 如何为自己的灵魂呐喊</span></p><p begin="03:41.596" end="03:44.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">Bring it on down rock, rock, rock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在颤动中 击坠一切</span></p><p begin="03:44.075" end="03:46.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">Shake it up, up, tap, top, top<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撼动世界 直至极限</span></p><p begin="03:46.300" end="03:50.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">Cuz you know how to shout out your soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你知道 如何为自己的灵魂呐喊</span></p><p begin="03:50.819" end="03:55.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">Time has come to listen to the crying of their puppet souls<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间已到 倾听他们傀儡般的哀嚎</span></p></div></body></tt>